</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1112/3618/6451/files/plush-email-hero-duo.jpg?v=1795092463" width="600" alt="Plush filtered shower head and spare cartridge" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;"></td></tr><tr><td class="pl-card" style="padding:28px 28px 0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:20px;"><tr><td style="padding:24px 24px 22px;">
